&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Distance&lt;/b&gt; &#233;pieu, +4 (1d6+1)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Attaques sp&#233;ciales&lt;/b&gt; coassement terrifiant (DD 13), repr&#233;sentation bardique 8 rounds/jour (contre-chant, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Distraction-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Distraction (Ext)&quot;&gt;distraction&lt;/a&gt;, fascination (DD 13), inspiration vaillante +1)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Sorts de barde connus&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Lancer-Des-Sorts#Nls.html&quot; title=&quot;NLS&quot;&gt;NLS&lt;/a&gt; 2 ; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Lancer-Des-Sorts#Concentration.html&quot; title=&quot;Concentration&quot;&gt;concentration&lt;/a&gt; +4)
&lt;/div&gt;
