&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Langues&lt;/b&gt; bourbi&#233;rin, commun, draconique
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
